commits.message:
ci: stop dependabot from bumping the MSRV rust-toolchain pin

dtolnay/rust-toolchain is tagged by Rust version, so dependabot read the
@1.88 MSRV-job pin as a stale action tag and opened a PR to bump it to
@1.100 — which would silently defeat the MSRV check. Ignore the action in
the github-actions group; its other uses are @stable and MSRV changes are
made by hand.
